<title>AUSTRIA: Bundeslaender 96 pretax rises 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Bundeslaender 96 pretax rises 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian insurer Bundeslaender Versicherungs-AG said on Wednesday 1996 pretax profit rose 15 percent to 162 million schillings, adding it would hold its dividend steady.</p>
<p>The company proposes paying an unchanged dividend on its preferred shares of 12 schillings, but does not plan paying a dividend on its ordinaries in order to strengthen shareholders' equity, Bundeslaender said in a statement. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
</text>
